### 1) Get a token (username OR email works). Paste the "access" value below.
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "owner", "password": "Owner@12345" }

### 2) Use it
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/Product/?search=rice&ordering=-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/Product/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Item", "sku": "TEST-001", "cost_price": 50, "selling_price": 70, "stock_quantity": 10 }

### Create an order (stock is reserved automatically)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/Order/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": 1, "discount": 0, "tax": 0, "items_input": [ { "product": 1, "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Change order status (PENDING / CONFIRMED / COMPLETED / CANCELLED)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/Order/1/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### AI forecast
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/forecasts/generate/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "days": 7 }

### Swagger UI: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/docs/   |   ReDoc: /api/v1/redoc/
